audit    show or export the audit log
bill     the bill of one or every tenant
cache    inspect or purge the response cache
check    run the consistency check
clock    show or move the logical clock
config   change and inspect layered settings
help     this text
job      queue or cancel one background job
jobs     run due jobs, list the queue
key      issue, revoke, rotate and list API keys
nonce    nonces remembered for a key
plan     list the subscription plans
quota    start a tenant's quota period afresh
rate     the rate window of a tenant
report   denial and per-tenant reports
req      send one request through the gateway
stats    global counters
tenant   create, re-plan, suspend and list tenants
top      tenants by accepted requests
usage    a tenant's quota, rate window and meter
webhook  deliveries waiting in the outbox
usage: key issue TENANT KEYID secret=SECRET [ttl=DURATION] [label=TEXT]
usage: key revoke TENANT KEYID
usage: key rotate TENANT KEYID secret=SECRET
usage: key list TENANT
usage: key show TENANT KEYID
setting quota.egress kind=size scope=tenant sensitive=no
  range 0B..1048576MiB
  built-in default value=1MiB
  built-in basic value=1MiB
  built-in free value=64KiB
  built-in pro value=64MiB
  response bytes per quota period
setting backend.token kind=text scope=tenant sensitive=yes
  text of at most 128 printable characters
  built-in default value=""
  credential the gateway presents upstream
setting replay.required kind=flag scope=tenant sensitive=no
  choices on off
  built-in default value=off
  when on, every request must carry nonce= and ts=
setting jobs.backoff kind=duration scope=tenant sensitive=no
  range 1ms..1h
  built-in default value=1s
  delay before the first retry; doubled for each later one
error: help: unknown setting nope
error: help: unknown command zzz
